### ====================================================================
### HESTA Smart Home - Main Door (Servo SG90) IoT & MQTT Test Suite
### ====================================================================
### Cấu hình thiết bị Cửa chính (Main Door):
### - Node ID:     109441d8-b6bf-4a18-bdf8-9279b7a1548d
### - Device ID:   70de950a-14b3-4b44-ac67-e2ff4e2c5d17
### - Device Type: DOOR
### - Cơ cấu:      Servo SG90 (GPIO 8, PWM 50Hz, 14-bit)
### - Góc mở:      90 độ (OPEN)
### - Góc đóng:    0 độ (CLOSED)
### - Topics MQTT:
###   + Command:   hesta/nodes/{{nodeId}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
###   + State:     hesta/nodes/{{nodeId}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/state
###   + ACK:       hesta/nodes/{{nodeId}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/ack
###   + Telemetry: hesta/nodes/{{nodeId}}/devices/{{deviceId}}/telemetry
### ====================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@deviceId = 70de950a-14b3-4b44-ac67-e2ff4e2c5d17
@nodeId = 109441d8-b6bf-4a18-bdf8-9279b7a1548d
#@token = 

### ====================================================================
### 0. (Optional) Login to obtain JWT Bearer token if authentication is enabled
### ====================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@gmail.com",
  "password": "123123123"
}

> {%
    if (response.body && response.body.result && response.body.result.accessToken) {
        client.global.set("token", response.body.result.accessToken);
    }
%}

### ====================================================================
### PHẦN 1: ĐIỀU KHIỂN CỬA QUA CHUYÊN BIỆT DOOR CONTROLLER API
### Endpoint Base: /api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/door/...
### ====================================================================

### 1.1 Lệnh MỞ CỬA (OPEN - 90 độ) qua shortcut endpoint
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/door/open?nodeId={{nodeId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1.2 Lệnh ĐÓNG CỬA (CLOSE - 0 độ) qua shortcut endpoint
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/door/close?nodeId={{nodeId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1.3 Lệnh DỪNG CỬA (STOP) qua shortcut endpoint
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/door/stop?nodeId={{nodeId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1.4 Gửi lệnh qua endpoint Door Command (Action: OPEN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/door/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "OPEN"
}

### 1.5 Gửi lệnh qua endpoint Door Command (Action: CLOSE kèm chỉ định Node ID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/door/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "CLOSE",
  "nodeId": "{{nodeId}}"
}

### 1.6 Gửi lệnh qua endpoint Door Command (Action: STOP)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/door/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "STOP"
}

### 1.7 Cấu hình tốc độ quay Servo (ms / độ, ví dụ 20ms/độ ~ 1.8s cho 90 độ)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/door/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "SET_SPEED",
  "speed": 20
}

### 1.8 Lấy trạng thái hiện tại của cửa (State, Angle, Speed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/door/state
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ====================================================================
### PHẦN 2: ĐIỀU KHIỂN CỬA QUA GENERIC DEVICE COMMAND API
### Endpoint Base: POST /api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
### ====================================================================

### 2.1 Generic Command - OPEN (Mở cửa 90 độ)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "OPEN"
}

### 2.2 Generic Command - CLOSE (Đóng cửa 0 độ)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "CLOSE"
}

### 2.3 Generic Command - STOP
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}/command
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "action": "STOP"
}

### 2.4 Xem chi tiết thiết bị Door từ Database
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/{{deviceId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ====================================================================
### PHẦN 3: MQTT TOPICS & PAYLOAD MẪU CHO CỬA CHÍNH (TEST BẰNG MQTTX / APP)
### ====================================================================
# Topic Gửi Lệnh:
# hesta/nodes/109441d8-b6bf-4a18-bdf8-9279b7a1548d/devices/70de950a-14b3-4b44-ac67-e2ff4e2c5d17/command
#
# Payload Mở cửa 90 độ:
# {"commandId": "cmd-door-open-01", "action": "OPEN"}
#
# Payload Đóng cửa 0 độ:
# {"commandId": "cmd-door-close-01", "action": "CLOSE"}
#
# Topic Nhận Trạng Thái (State):
# hesta/nodes/109441d8-b6bf-4a18-bdf8-9279b7a1548d/devices/70de950a-14b3-4b44-ac67-e2ff4e2c5d17/state
#
# Topic Nhận Phản Hồi Xác Nhận (ACK):
# hesta/nodes/109441d8-b6bf-4a18-bdf8-9279b7a1548d/devices/70de950a-14b3-4b44-ac67-e2ff4e2c5d17/ack

